  "description": "meme-id: section_3_devide_and_rule; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image displays a collection of knives with overlaid text that promotes a divisive and discriminatory narrative about religion-based riots, specifically blaming Hindus and absolving minorities of guilt. This content is hateful as it targets a specific religious group (Hindus) and promotes harmful stereotypes by suggesting they are unfairly targeted and that minorities are not held accountable for violence against them. The juxtaposition of violent imagery (knives) with text promoting systemic injustice and scapegoating constitutes a direct attack on a protected community based on religion, fitting the definition of hateful content.",
